@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Index a document (2 headings → at least 2 chunks)
POST {{host}}/documents
X-Tenant-Id: acme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "refund-policy",
  "title": "Refund policy",
  "url": "https://intranet/policies/refunds",
  "allowedGroups": ["all-staff"],
  "text": "# Refunds\nCustomers can return shoes within 30 days.\n# Electronics\nElectronics can be returned within 15 days, unopened."
}

### 2. Same request again → "unchanged" (same hash, no embedding call)

### 3. Permissions changed → plain UPDATE, no re-embedding
PUT {{host}}/documents/refund-policy/permissions
X-Tenant-Id: acme
Content-Type: application/json

{ "allowedGroups": ["hr"] }

### 4. Source document deleted → document + chunks gone (cascade)
DELETE {{host}}/documents/refund-policy
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Model upgrade: set Embeddings:DualWrite = true (new uploads get v1 + v2, backfill fills old rows),
### wait for "v2 backfill done" in the log, then set Embeddings:QueryVersion = "v2". Roll back = set it to "v1".

### 5. Ask: hybrid search → rerank → LLM → checked citations
POST {{host}}/ask
X-Tenant-Id: acme
X-User-Groups: all-staff
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How long do I have to return headphones?" }

### Expected: { "answer": "Electronics can be returned within 15 days if unopened [1].",
###             "citations": [{ "number": 1, "title": "Refund policy", "heading": "Electronics", "url": "https://intranet/policies/refunds" }] }

### 6. A question no document covers → "I don't know", with no LLM call (reranker scores below MinScore)
POST {{host}}/ask
X-Tenant-Id: acme
X-User-Groups: all-staff
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the parking policy?" }

### 7. Debug an answer: paste the traceId from request 5
GET {{host}}/ask/PASTE_TRACE_ID/trace
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Expected (shortened):
### { "TraceId": "...", "Question": "How long do I have to return headphones?", "EmbeddingVersion": "v1",
###   "KeywordIds": [2], "VectorIds": [2, 1], "RrfIds": [2, 1],
###   "RerankScores": [{ "ChunkId": 2, "Score": 0.94 }, { "ChunkId": 1, "Score": 0.12 }],
###   "PromptSourceIds": [2], "PromptVersion": "rag-v1", "Model": "gpt-4.1-mini",
###   "InputTokens": 310, "CachedInputTokens": 0, "OutputTokens": 18, "CostUsd": 0.000153,
###   "StageMs": { "search": 140, "rerank": 210, "llm": 900 } }
